{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan an Nasai","section":{"24":{"eng-name":"The Book of Hajj","ara-name":"كتاب مناسك الحج"}},"section_detail":{"24":{"hadithnumber_first":2619,"hadithnumber_last":3084,"arabicnumber_first":2619,"arabicnumber_last":3084}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":2911,"arabicnumber":2911,"text":"Rapporté par Aisha رضي الله عنها : J’ai dit : \"Ô Messager d’Allah ! Est-ce que je ne peux pas entrer dans la Maison ?\" Il a dit : \"Entre dans le Hijr car il fait partie de la Maison","grades":[{"name":"Abu Ghuddah","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Isnaad Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":24,"hadith":294},"chapter":{"id":128,"ara-name":"باب الْحِجْرِ","eng-name":"The Hijr","isFirstHadith":false}}]}